WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.129 --> 00:00:05.559
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this is going
to be my Agents of SHIELD Episode 8 video.

00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:10.809
I’m actually glad I waited a day to post
this because a bunch of big Marvel news just

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:13.430
broke so I’ll explain all that real quick
first.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:17.470
We just found out which lead actors Marvel
is testing for the leads in both the Jessica

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.130
Jones and Luke Cage Netflix series.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.130
Agents of SHIELD season 1 is also hitting
netflix this thursday.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:24.789
For Jessica Jones it’s Alexandra Daddario
from True Detective and Percy Jackson, Jessica

00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:29.039
De Gouw who we all know and love as The Huntress
on Arrow, Krysten Ritter who you might remember

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:32.780
from Breaking Bad and Teresa Palmer from Warm
Bodies.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:37.810
For Luke Cage they’re testing Lance Goss
from Good Wife and Mike Colter from The Following.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:44.410
I’ll do separate videos for them after Agents
of SHIELD is over but Jessica Jones will premiere

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.410
first.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:49.870
Luke Cage will be in 6 or 7 episodes of that
and then he’ll move to his own series.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:56.040
That’s supposed to premiere late in 2015,
that’s their goal.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.560
Daredevil of course is almost done filming,
no release date for that yet.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.300
Probably spring or summer next year.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:05.689
I’ll say Alexandra Daddario is probably
the favorite for Jessica Jones right now.

00:01:05.689 --> 00:01:09.799
The other news ties in with Agents of SHIELD
and it’s kind of spoilery so I’ll work

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:11.950
that in to my top 5 moments.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:15.119
Careful for spoilers from this week’s episode
if you’re not caught up.

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:16.509
Starting with my TOP 5

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.819
Number 5 - Hydra Flashbacks

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:22.530
This whole episode was more of a HYDRA episode
in general which I love.

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:24.890
With a giant Red Skull shout out.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:30.420
We don’t spend a lot of time telling stories
from their perspective.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:34.729
Even Winter Soldier only flirted with the
idea and that was a $150 Million Dollar HYDRA

00:01:34.729 --> 00:01:35.729
movie.

00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:39.259
Doctor Whitehall takes center stage and we
watch the horror of his World War 2 experiments

00:01:39.259 --> 00:01:41.289
trying to figure out the diviner.

00:01:41.289 --> 00:01:45.969
If you didn’t notice her, the special woman
that turned out to be Skye’s Mother was

00:01:45.969 --> 00:01:48.090
a fellow whedonverse alumn from Dollhouse.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.689
Her name is Dichen Lachman.

00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:53.709
Reed Diamond who’s playing Doctor Whitehall
is also from Dollhouse so this is like a mini

00:01:53.709 --> 00:01:55.590
Joss Whedon reunion.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.130
So anytime you watch SHIELD just keep your
eyes peeled for actors that have starred in

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:06.469
other Joss Whedon productions.

00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:10.700
Their previous connection makes this interrogation
scene that much more shocking especially given

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:13.620
the reveal that she’s able to activate the
Diviner.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:17.660
Cut to the Peggy Carter plot

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.880
Number 4 - Team Coulson Searches For The City

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.080
The good guys plot took a backseat to all
the HYDRA stuff.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.610
There were still a lot of big reveals.

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:29.700
First one was that their base they’ve been
using all year is the original SSR Base that

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.970
Peggy Carter used.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.730
That means when the Peggy Carter tv series
premieres.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.010
It will also probably take place in this base.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.000
So they’ll just re-dress the sets.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.780
After the first episode and seeing the way
they shared the Doctor Whitehall villain I

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.370
thought SHIELD and Peggy Carter might do a
shared story.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:55.560
I don’t know how much of their big arcs
they’ll share, the only thing I know about

00:02:55.560 --> 00:03:00.600
the Peggy Carter show is who some of the characters
are.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.960
I don’t know who the big villain is yet.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.930
They might stick with the TAHITI mystery as
a way to tie things back to the present.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.540
Coulson and crew though, not going to bother
trying to get the diviner back.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.940
They’re going straight for the finish line
and they’ll just park it till HYDRA gets

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.100
there with the diviner.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:22.460
That’s happening in the mid season finale
next week.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.260
Number 3 - Ward versus Brother of Ward

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.380
Since turning him HYDRA, Ward has been so
much more fun.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:32.460
I really like Brett Dalton as an actor but
Quarterback Ward from season 1 was barely

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.730
a character.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.740
HYDRA Ward, so much better.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:48.710
That’s why I was never sure whether or not
he was telling the truth about killing his

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:49.890
younger brother.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:53.160
The episode was called “Things We Bury”
and the Well became a nice mirror for Doctor

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.300
Whitehall getting buried by Peggy Carter.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.620
Nothing stays buried forever.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.110
Namely awful things from the past.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.900
Which kind of reminds me of Marvel’s Original
Sin storyline from the comics this year.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:00.900
If you haven’t read it you should check
it out.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:06.150
Awful things from everyone’s past coming
back to haunt them.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:09.050
If you were confused by the end of the episode
with Ward and Whitehall.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.470
The episode jumped forward really fast between
the well scene and that last scene.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:15.340
I think Ward killed his brother’s family
then traveled to that meeting.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:19.090
I don’t think he secretly saved his brother
and faked the fire.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.720
Although that is a possibility.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.070
I don’t know where his character is headed.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.560
He just keeps doing all these awful things.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.280
The back half of the season will presumably
explain all that.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.420
If he’s ever going to find any redemption.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:34.490
Right now he’s like the Winter Soldier of
Coulson’s SHIELD team.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:38.350
Not super evil but not a good character either.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:43.940
The three way alliance they have going on
inside HYDRA.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:48.041
Think about the idea of HYDRA eating it’s
own heads.

00:04:48.041 --> 00:05:04.580
One head bites another bites another.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:24.660
I just like the visual metaphor and what that
implies.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:46.870
Number 2 - Skye’s Father Explained

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:51.470
and my Number 1 WTF moment - Doctor Whitehall
Explained

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:52.910
For those that were asking me on twitter.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.460
Here’s what I think Whitehall did to Skye’s
mother.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:58.690
He said he took ‘everything he could’
from her.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:03.419
That probably means he harvested all her internal
organs and any blood plasma, liquids and special

00:06:03.419 --> 00:06:05.240
metahuman organic parts he found.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:07.040
I mentioned something huge was confirmed this
morning.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:11.480
One of the executive producers confirmed the
Blue TAHITI Alien was a Kree.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:15.639
That to me is the strongest evidence for Inhumans
we could ever get.

00:06:15.639 --> 00:06:17.210
For those that haven’t read the comics.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.740
The Inhumans were created by the Kree.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:23.800
Thousands of years ago Kree scientists traveled
to earth to turn humans into a weaponized

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.930
army to use in their ongoing war with the
Skrulls.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:32.760
So the inhumans were originally meant to be
part of the Kree Army, things went sideways

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:44.130
for the Kree and the Inhumans were left by
themselves for thousands of years.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:49.550
They live in the secret city of Attilan, which
I think is the secret city Coulson is looking

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.550
for.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.479
Marvel is making an Inhumans movie in a couple
years.

00:06:52.479 --> 00:06:54.460
And suddenly everything is connected.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.910
Skye’s Mother was probably an inhuman.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:57.940
Making Skye and inhuman.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.430
That’s why they’re able to touch the diviner.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.970
Eveything will be answered next week.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.420
But just to reiterate.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:08.840
Even if we see super powered inhumans on agents
of shield, I don’t think we’d ever see

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:09.840
the royal family.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.680
Black Bolt, Medusa, you get the idea.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.150
They’ll probably save those characters for
the movies.

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:16.590
Plus none of them have been cast yet.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:23.949
I think the temple skye’s father spoke about
is where the inhumans can activate their powers.

00:07:23.949 --> 00:07:25.040
As in terrigen mists.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:33.060
He said the diviner has something inside it,
it could be a terrigen crystal.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.470
So I think if skye were to carry the diviner
into said temple, she’d activate her inhuman

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.470
powers.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.470
Whatever those might be.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.680
There is a theory she could be Daisy Johnson
from the comics aka Quake and she’d get

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.169
earthshaking powers.

00:07:44.169 --> 00:07:47.880
In the comics she had a scientist father named
Mr Hyde that did experiments kind of like

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.810
what Skye’s father has been doing.

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:53.550
That’s just the best theory I’ve seen
so far.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:59.940
Let me know though, what was your favorite
moment and my big question for you guys is

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:05.870
do you think this is an inhumans story and
that city will lead to Attilan?

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:09.570
Overall I gave the episode a B plus, loved
the HYDRA side of the story but I felt like

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:13.009
the Coulson SHIELD side wasn’t able to match
the energy.

00:08:13.009 --> 00:08:16.700
Yes Tripp almost dying was a big deal but
characters having sex in the back of a car

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.490
won’t hold a candle to harvesting organs.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:26.310
The actors are all amazing, Brett Dalton definitely
on his A game, Kyle Maclachlan was appropriately

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.310
crazy.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:33.260
I can’t wait to see more of him being nuts.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:36.169
Reed Diamond as Whitehall is still a bit of
a mystery.

00:08:36.169 --> 00:08:37.710
I want the show to spend more time with him.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:41.220
He’s an amazing actor but they’ve been
keeping him in the background thus far.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:45.310
Just in general I feel like SHIELD has become
a more interesting show since season 1.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:50.150
There’s a clear villain, Doctor Whitehall,
with a lot of ambiguous villains like Skye’s

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.550
Father and neutral Loki type characters like
Ward.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:58.770
I’ll try to do more Marvel Universe Inhumans
videos in the next week since shield is going

00:08:58.770 --> 00:08:59.770
on break.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:06.570
Peggy Carter starts January 6th and I will
be doing weekly videos for that so be sure

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.220
to subscribe to get everything.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:26.260
I’m going to try to do some Netflix Series
videos to since Marvel is posting a lot of

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:30.639
official stuff for them now too.

